WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.160
WHERE IS MY CARD?

00:00:33.160 --> 00:01:08.180
FROM QUESTION TO QUEUE.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:48.300
NEEDS CLARIFICATION

00:01:48.300 --> 00:02:11.900
UNRELATED QUESTION

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:42.820
MEASURE THE ROUTING TRADEOFF.

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:58.860
ONE DATASET. FIVE ROLES.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:21.360
COMPARE. THEN SELECT.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:54.920
STOP. RESTORE. VERIFY.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:04:39.920
EVIDENCE TRAVELS WITH THE MODEL.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:05:18.550
A MODEL YOU CAN INSPECT.
